WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:15.310
So it's Friday night.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:21.170
I'm a young college student at this time. I'm attending a party at another university.

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:24.010
I'm making my way through this party...

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:29.780
...and I notice that there is this guy standing
a distance away from me and he's just staring

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.350
at me.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:35.650
I don't pay any attention. I keep doing my
thing.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:40.150
Every now and then I look up and the guy is
a little bit closer, still staring at me.

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.680
I still don't paid any attention.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:47.580
At one point, I'm talking to someone when suddenly I hear these words behind me:

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:49.940
"What did you say?"

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:54.680
I turned around and is this guy standing right
in my face.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.860
I turned back around to look at the guy that
I was talking to to see if he was talking

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:03.899
to him by any chance and then I turned back to
look at him and I was like "Are you talking to me?"

00:01:03.899 --> 00:01:06.440
And he was like "Yeah! What did you say?"

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:09.980
And I was like "I didn't say anything to you."

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:14.640
And as soon as I said that, this guy takes
his face and *BOOM* -- right in my face.

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:17.800
My head snaps back.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:20.130
And I'm like--

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:22.440
I don't respond.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:27.580
I look around and I suddenly notice that he's
got his friends surrounding me.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:31.060
I estimate probably twenty of them.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.060
And I'm thinking to myself:

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:38.240
"Things are about to go down. This is not good."

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:42.400
Have you ever felt surrounded by difficulties?

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:48.799
Like those difficulties spotted you from a
distance and worked their way towards you

00:01:48.799 --> 00:01:52.780
only to come upon you like an overwhelming
surprise?

00:01:52.780 --> 00:02:00.729
Yes, sometimes it can feel like you're surrounded
and outnumbered by these unrelenting trials

00:02:00.729 --> 00:02:07.299
of life. Sometimes, you can feel like you're
all alone and without the help you need.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:12.960
Like the enemy has you in a position that
there is no way for you to escape.

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:15.660
But I need you to remember something.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:18.730
If you have God on your side,

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:21.090
God is going to have your back.

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:26.599
So the Bible tells the story of the prophet
Elisha. The king of Syria wants to take this

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:34.780
prophet of God out and so he sends his entire
army--his "crew", if you will, to take Elisha and his servant.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:40.340
Well the Bible tells us that the
servant sees this army and he goes into a 
 panic.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.580
He says to Elisha "We're surrounded! We're done for! What are we going to do?"

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:49.840
But you see, this servant did not understand something:
When God is on your side, you have nothing to fear.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:55.460
When God is on your side, you can have
a peace that passes all understanding.

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:59.980
Elisha says to the servant "Don't worry about it." His
responses epic.

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:09.960
He says "They that be with us are more than they that be with them." And then Elisha prays "Lord, open the eyes of my servant that he may see."

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:14.680
The Bible says that the
eyes of his servant was open and he saw:

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:24.320
Chariots of fire surrounding their enemies. You see, it is true. They that were with God were

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:29.420
more than they that were with the enemy. That's what we need to pray.

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:36.280
"Lord, open our eyes and we may see." When we feel like we're all alone, when we feel like we are surrounded by the enemy,

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:42.340
pray "Open my eyes so that I can see."

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:48.800
So back to the war story. I was surrounded, but I was not afraid.

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:55.080
You see, my eyes lookout past that group of people and over in the distance was my brother.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:04:01.080
It was his college that I was visiting that night. I looked in another direction and I spotted--about twenty

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.260
yards out--my best friend.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:08.920
He was there also. It was his college as well. And so I called out to him. He didn't hear me.

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:13.660
I yelled out again a little bit louder
and as soon as he turned and his eyes caught

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:17.610
mine, I was like "We got beef!"

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:22.079
And that's all I needed to say. I turned back to the guy who was standing there waiting

00:04:22.079 --> 00:04:27.110
for me to do something and it was on.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:30.860
Even though I knew that twenty guys were about to rush in on me, I didn't care.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:38.400
Why? Because that night, the "X-men" were there. That's the name of our crew. We were about thirty to forty deep.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:42.950
You see, they thought that I was alone.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:44.440
But I was not alone.

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:48.170
You guys, I want you to remember this.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:52.110
You're never alone when God is on your side.

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:57.040
Look...living in this world is crazy. This is
the kind of life I used to live.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:04.040
It's not something I'm proud of and if I saw this guy today, I'd love him as a brother regardless.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:09.640
I'm an ex-brawler today, but I want you to see the lesson
from this war story.

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:17.480
When God is on your side, when God is for you, it may seem like you're surrounded and that there's no way out.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:24.410
But they that be with you--God and the angels--are more than the trials that surrounds you.

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:28.660
Having that knowledge, go forward and fight the good fight of faith.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:35.260
Listen; that night, my fight, my attitude was fierce, unrelenting, and fearless.

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:41.380
Go into your battle the same way; fierce, unrelenting, and fearless.

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:48.250
Don't worry about the trials that surround
you. Just know that God has them surrounded.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:53.830
To this day, our crew is still family. We still
call ourselves the "X-men". Ironically, when

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:59.840
I became a Christian, I learned that the letter X was the ancient symbol for Christ.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:04.080
That means that as a Christian, I'm still an X-man.

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:09.540
"X" also means "former", so the person I was twenty years ago, I'm no longer that person.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:15.170
But I'm still a fighter. Listen. As spiritual
"X-men", Christian men and women, we should be

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:20.980
ready to fight spiritually on behalf of our
"crew". And who is our crew?

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.620
Humanity--friend and enemy.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:28.580
Yes, even our personal enemies.
That's what an "X-man" is called to do.

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:35.340
Jesus calls us to pray for our enemies--to
go to battle on their behalf, not against them.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:41.000
And look; our fellow "X-men" should be able to call out to us when they are in their greatest need--

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:46.280
when they are surrounded, and they should be able to trust that their crew will go to

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:49.280
battle on their behalf.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:50.700
Listen.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:54.840
Remember that God has your back.

00:06:54.860 --> 00:07:01.600
Ask the Lord to open your eyes so that you can see that they that be with you are more

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:08.120
than they that be with them. Have courage and fight the good fight of faith.

